WEBVTT

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.406
just to perform basic
arithmetic operations.

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.886
And I got the highest notes.

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:03.666
I got a 10 out of 10.

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.106
AG: This is Nico Neumann.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.035
When he was in high school in Argentina,

00:20:07.059 --> 00:20:09.406
his favorite subject was computer science.

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:12.326
NN: I promised my parents
that I was going to build, like,

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.188
robots that clean the house. (Laughs)

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.046
AG: But like many people on the spectrum,

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:20.126
Nico had difficulty connecting
with his peers at school.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:23.075
So after three years
of frustration and isolation,

00:20:23.099 --> 00:20:25.106
he approached his parents with a proposal.

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:27.539
NN: "Dad, Mom, I don't want
to go to school anymore

00:20:27.563 --> 00:20:30.124
because I feel that it's
just not doing good for me."